## 3. CORE PLATFORM MODULES & FOUR-TIER DELIVERABLES

### 1. Customer Super App (iOS & Android)
* **Single Sign-On Unified Interface:** Instant toggle between three core Phase 1 utilities: **Swiftly Rides** (Keke Hailing), **Swiftly Food** (Restaurant & Bakery Ordering), and **Swiftly Send** (Intra-City Parcel Dispatch).
* **Swiftly Rides (Keke Napep Hailing):** Digital hailing with upfront zone and distance-based fare calculations, driver photo/plate verification, union-aligned security ratings, and live vehicle approach tracking.
* **Swiftly Food Ordering Engine:** Rich digital storefronts for curated restaurants, live kitchen prep status, customizable food options, item variations, and temperature-conscious insulated box delivery routing.
* **Swiftly Send (P2P & B2B Logistics):** Instant motorcycle/keke courier dispatch for items under 25kg, live route tracking, digital Proof of Delivery (OTP verification + recipient photo capture), and express multi-stop drops.
* **Unified In-App Wallet:** In-app balance funding via Paystack/Moniepoint (Debit Cards, USSD, Automated Virtual Accounts), peer-to-peer wallet transfers, and automated promo credit vouchers.

### 2. Driver & Fleet Partner App (Android-First)
* **One-Tap Shift & Demand Radar:** Online/Offline toggle with audible acoustic trip broadcast chimes and heatmaps highlighting high-demand zones.
* **Dynamic Cross-Dispatch Modes:** Drivers seamlessly transition between passenger hailing requests, restaurant pickup tickets, and market courier parcels without switching applications.
* **Turn-by-Turn Navigation & Route Optimization:** Built-in lightweight corridor navigation avoiding congested choke points.
* **Transparent Driver Wallet & Daily Cash Ledger:** Real-time visibility into daily trips, gross fare breakdowns, platform commission debits, cash collections, and instant 24/7 bank withdrawals.

### 3. Merchant & Restaurant Partner Hub (Web & Tablet)
* **Digital Menu & Inventory Manager:** Real-time item pricing, photo uploads, ingredient variations, stock-out toggles, and operating hours scheduling.
* **Kitchen Order Display & Ticket Printing:** Automated audio alert for new incoming orders, estimated food prep timers, and Bluetooth receipt printer integration.
* **Sales Analytics & Settlement Ledger:** Daily gross sales tracking, net platform payout reports, and customer review monitoring.

### 4. Master Operations, Dispatch & Administration Dashboard (Web)
* **Live City Command Heatmap:** Real-time spatial visualization of all active Keke tricycles and dispatch bikes across Aba and Umuahia corridors.
* **Geofencing & Dynamic Zone Pricing Engine:** Granular polygon boundary controls to define operating corridors, base fares, per-kilometer rates, night surge multipliers, and union levy allocations.
* **Driver Onboarding & KYC Verification Gate:** Comprehensive identity review (NIN, Driver’s License, vehicle chassis number, union membership ID) with one-click verification badge approvals.
* **Financial Ledger & Automated Commission Splits:** Multi-tier accounting tracking platform take-rates (12%–18% on Rides, 15%–25% on Food, 15%–20% on Logistics) with automated NIP bank disbursement automation.

